{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22000","headline":"秦中吟十首 立碑 · 白居易","name":"秦中吟十首 立碑","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"勳德既下衰，文章亦陵夷。\n但见山中石，立作路旁碑。\n铭勳悉太公，叙德皆仲尼。\n复以多爲贵，千言直万赀。\n爲文彼何人，想见下笔时。\n但欲愚者悦，不思贤者嗤。\n岂独贤者嗤，仍传後代疑。\n古石苍苔字，安知是媿词。\n我闻望江县，麴令抚惸嫠。\n在官有仁政，名不闻京师。\n身殁欲归葬，百姓遮路岐。\n攀辕不得归，留葬此江湄。\n至今道其名，男女涕皆垂。\n无人立碑碣，唯有邑人知。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22000.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22000","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}